CZ 3 1 5 7
TICK
# CZ layer 2/4: CZ Q38-Q37 Q52-Q51, 176 ns (longest CZ in layer)
CZ 4 6 3 2
TICK
# CZ layer 3/4: CZ Q36-Q37 Q50-Q51, 104 ns (longest CZ in layer)
CZ 0 6 5 2
TICK
# CZ layer 4/4: CZ Q36-Q43 Q38-Q45, 108 ns (longest CZ in layer)
CZ 0 7 4 1
TICK
# RX(+pi/2) on ancillas, 40 ns
SQRT_X 0 3 4 5
TICK
# Fig. 2(j): MEASURE Q36,Q38,Q52,Q50 (pulses 984/976/952/948 ns) then ring-down DELAY 192/336/168/144 ns; no reset
M 0 4 3 5
# decoding round 3: detector = m_r xor m_(r-2) for each ancilla (round 2: m_2 alone)
DETECTOR(3, 7, 2) rec[-2] rec[-10]  # Q52, check Z45Z51
DETECTOR(1, 7, 2) rec[-1] rec[-9]  # Q50, check Z43Z51
DETECTOR(3, 5, 2) rec[-3] rec[-11]  # Q38, check Z37Z45
DETECTOR(1, 5, 2) rec[-4] rec[-12]  # Q36, check Z37Z43
# ======== syndrome-extraction round 5 / 9 ========
TICK
# RX(+pi/2) on ancillas, 40 ns
SQRT_X 5 3 0 4
TICK
# CZ layer 1/4: CZ Q52-Q45 Q50-Q43, 104 ns (longest CZ in layer)
CZ 3 1 5 7
TICK
# CZ layer 2/4: CZ Q38-Q37 Q52-Q51, 176 ns (longest CZ in layer)
CZ 4 6 3 2
